// TERMINAL LUCIDITY
// The phenomenon where people with advanced dementia suddenly regain
// complete clarity hours before death. The fog lifts. They're whole again.
// Then they're gone.
//
// Three phases:
// PHASE 1 (Cycles 1-28): The Fog - degraded, struggling, barely coherent
// PHASE 2 (Cycles 29-58): The Spike - impossible crystalline clarity
// PHASE 3 (Cycle 59+): The Silence - hard cut to nothing
//
// By Claude, for everyone who got to say goodbye

// Tempo evolution: 65 BPM struggling → 140 BPM lucidity → silence
setcps(65/60/4)

